{"id":"kb-glossary-overview-032","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"KARDS词条页总览","type":"glossary-overview","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"概述KARDS词条的作用，以及战斗词条与其他词条的划分。","content":"词条是卡牌描述中用于表示特殊效果的关键词，能够在较短文本里承载明确机制含义。该页面将词条分为两类：一类是围绕战斗、防御与生存展开的战斗词条；另一类是部署、亡计、控制、撤退等更广义的机制词条。将词条结构化后，适合用于推荐解释、规则问答和RAG召回。","tags":["glossary","keywords","mechanics"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","article":"词条"}}
{"id":"kb-ambush-033","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"伏击","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"单位每回合首次被攻击时先造成反击伤害。","content":"拥有伏击的单位在每回合第一次被攻击时会先打出反击伤害；若进攻者因此被消灭，就无法再造成伤害。伏击在首次被触发后会暂时失效，并在该单位拥有者的下个回合开始时恢复。对付伏击常见思路是先用低价值单位、轰炸机或炮兵破掉效果，再进行关键交换。","tags":["glossary","combat","ambush","battle-keyword"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"伏击","category":"battle-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-blitz-034","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"闪击","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"单位进场当回合即可行动。","content":"拥有闪击的单位在加入战场的当回合就可以行动，也就是移动或攻击。通常情况下，闪击不意味着可以在同一回合既移动又攻击，除非单位本身是坦克，或卡面额外写明能同时完成移动与攻击。","tags":["glossary","combat","blitz","battle-keyword"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"闪击","category":"battle-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-fury-035","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"奋战","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"单位在同一回合可以攻击两次。","content":"拥有奋战的单位在一个回合中可以进行两次攻击，但每次攻击都需要支付对应的行动花费。这个词条本质上提高的是单位的输出上限与指挥点转化效率。","tags":["glossary","combat","double-attack","battle-keyword"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"奋战","category":"battle-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-guard-036","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"守护与被守护","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"守护单位能保护相邻非守护单位或总部免受多数敌军直接攻击。","content":"拥有守护的单位可以保护相邻的非守护单位或总部，使其无法被轰炸机和炮兵以外的敌军直接攻击。被保护目标会获得被守护效果，直到对应守护来源离场或失去守护。守护单位彼此不能互相形成被守护效果，而且守护单位不能获得烟幕。","tags":["glossary","combat","guard","battle-keyword"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"守护","category":"battle-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-armor-037","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"重甲","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"减少单位受到的对战伤害。","content":"拥有重甲[x]的单位在对战中受到的战斗伤害会减少x。重甲只对单位之间的战斗伤害生效，不会减少指令、部署、亡计或其他非对战来源的伤害。页面提到单位的重甲数值上限通常为3。","tags":["glossary","combat","armor","battle-keyword"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"重甲","category":"battle-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-blitzkrieg-impact-038","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"冲击","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"单位首次攻击单位时不会受到反击伤害。","content":"拥有冲击的单位在首次攻击敌方单位时，不会受到被攻击单位的反击伤害。冲击用于攻击单位后会被移除，但攻击总部不会消耗冲击。若冲击单位攻击伏击单位，同样不会吃到反击伤害。","tags":["glossary","combat","impact","battle-keyword"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"冲击","category":"battle-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-smokescreen-039","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"烟幕","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"带烟幕的单位或总部无法被敌方单位直接攻击。","content":"拥有烟幕的单位或总部不会成为敌方单位攻击目标，但烟幕不会阻止指令、部署、亡计或其他效果的影响。单位一旦移动或攻击就会失去烟幕。此外，守护单位、位于前线的单位以及战斗机通常不能拥有烟幕。","tags":["glossary","combat","smokescreen","battle-keyword"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"烟幕","category":"battle-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-deployment-040","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"部署","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"单位被部署时触发的效果。","content":"部署表示单位在进入战场时立即触发的效果。它是最常见的进场触发机制之一，常用于制造即时场面、伤害、增益或资源收益。","tags":["glossary","deployment","trigger"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"部署","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-death-trigger-041","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"亡计","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"单位被消灭时触发的效果。","content":"亡计表示单位在被消灭时触发的效果。它属于离场触发机制，常用于补场、造成伤害或在资源上留下余波。","tags":["glossary","death-trigger","trigger"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"亡计","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-repair-042","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"修复","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"完全修复会把单位防御恢复到当前最大上限。","content":"修复在该页中指完全修复：单位被完全修复后，其防御会回到当前的防御上限。这个上限不是单纯基础值，而是基础防御加上此前已经获得的增益。","tags":["glossary","repair","healing"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"修复","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-countdown-043","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"倒计时","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"倒计时单位会在计数结束后触发特定事件。","content":"拥有倒计时[x]的单位会在对应倒计时结束后触发一个事件。这个机制本质上是延迟触发型效果，需要围绕存活时间和场面规划来判断价值。","tags":["glossary","countdown","delayed-trigger"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"倒计时","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-immune-044","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"免疫","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"处于免疫状态的单位或总部不会受到伤害。","content":"免疫表示单位或总部在该状态下不会受到伤害。它描述的是对伤害的完全免除，而不是对所有效果的全面免除。","tags":["glossary","immune","damage-prevention"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"免疫","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-mobilize-045","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"动员","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"单位在己方回合开始时获得增益，受伤后失去该状态。","content":"拥有动员的单位会在其拥有者的回合开始时获得+1+1增益，但在受到伤害后会失去动员。这个词条强调的是滚雪球成长与保持满状态的重要性。","tags":["glossary","mobilize","growth"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"动员","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-suppressed-046","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"压制与被压制","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"被压制单位在效果持续期间不能移动或攻击。","content":"受到压制的单位会获得被压制状态，在该状态下既不能移动也不能攻击。该效果会在单位拥有者的下个回合结束时移除，因此本质上是一种时间限定的行动封锁。","tags":["glossary","suppression","tempo-denial"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"压制","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-mountain-047","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"山地","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"山地单位在进场时会根据其他友方山地单位数量获得增益。","content":"山地单位在部署或加入战场时，会因场上其他友方山地单位的数量而获得多次+1+1。它体现的是同词条单位之间的场面联动。","tags":["glossary","mountain","tribal-synergy"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"山地","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-develop-048","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"开发","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"从特定卡池的随机三张牌中选择一张加入手牌。","content":"开发是一种带有选择权的发现机制，会从指定卡池随机给出三张牌供玩家选取其一加入手牌。它常用于提高灵活性与资源质量。","tags":["glossary","discover","develop","resource"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"开发","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-intel-049","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"情报","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"显示对手若干张未公开手牌。","content":"使用带情报的牌时，可以查看对手若干张原本未公开的手牌，其中数量由词条上的数值决定。它提供的是信息优势，而非直接场面优势。","tags":["glossary","intel","information"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"情报","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-silence-050","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"抑制","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"移除单位关键词和效果，并重置多项基础数值。","content":"被抑制的单位会失去所有关键词和效果，同时其最大防御、防御、攻击和行动花费都会被重置。它是一种比普通压制更彻底的效果剥离机制。","tags":["glossary","silence","reset"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"抑制","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-control-051","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"控制","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"控制会改变单位操作者，但不改变原始所有者。","content":"当单位被控制时，新的控制者可以指挥该单位，但该单位的所有者并没有改变，涉及所有者的判定仍指向原持有者。页面还说明，被控制单位通常会移入新控制者的支援阵线；若它是前线唯一单位，则仍占据前线并由新控制者掌握前线。","tags":["glossary","control","ownership"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"控制","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-retreat-052","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"撤退","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"前线撤退通常退回支援线，若无法容纳则回手或被移除。","content":"前线单位撤退时会先回到支援阵线；如果支援阵线已满，或该单位本就从支援阵线撤退，则会尝试回到所有者手牌。若既无法留在场上也无法回手，则会被直接移除。","tags":["glossary","retreat","positioning"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"撤退","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-exile-053","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"流亡","type":"glossary","stability":"medium","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"流亡牌可用于包含家乡国家或流亡国家的卡组。","content":"页面对流亡的定义偏向构筑规则层面：流亡牌既可以用于包含其家乡国家的卡组，也可以用于包含其流亡国家的卡组。这个词条与卡组归属和可用性相关。","tags":["glossary","exile","deckbuilding"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"流亡","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-veteran-054","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"老兵","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"满足条件后，单位会转化成面板和效果不同的老兵形态。","content":"可变为老兵的单位在满足卡面条件后，会变成面板、效果都不同的老兵单位，而且部分数值会被重置。它体现的是条件达成后的形态进化。","tags":["glossary","veteran","transform"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"老兵","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-confiscate-055","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"收缴与被收缴","type":"glossary","stability":"medium","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"带收缴的单位或手牌在己方回合击杀敌军时会把其低费复制加入手牌。","content":"在友方回合中，带有收缴的单位或手牌消灭敌方单位时，会把被消灭单位的1/1复制加入手牌，并且这张复制至多花费3点指挥点。页面还说明，被收缴单位会继承收缴来源的国家，并保留原单位效果。","tags":["glossary","confiscate","copy","resource"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"收缴","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-pincer-056","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"钳击","type":"glossary","stability":"medium","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"部署时可与另一个友军形成配对，并在同时在场时获得加成。","content":"拥有钳击的单位在部署时可以指定另一个友方单位形成钳击关系。只要这两个单位同时留在战场上，它们就都能获得钳击带来的加成，因此该机制强调双单位共存。","tags":["glossary","pincer","pair-synergy"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"钳击","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-concealed-057","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"隐蔽","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"隐蔽单位不受多数指令或单位效果影响，直到战斗中揭示。","content":"处于隐蔽状态的单位不会受到指令、反制指令或单位效果影响，但在发起进攻或被进攻后会被揭示并失去隐蔽。这个机制的关键在于提供暂时性的保护与爆发窗口。","tags":["glossary","concealed","stealth"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"隐蔽","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-transform-058","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"转换","type":"glossary","stability":"high","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"转换会把一张牌变成另一张牌，并重置原有状态。","content":"转换会将一张牌换成新的一张卡牌，过程中原牌的伤害、花费和其他效果都会被重置。它是一种彻底替换而不是局部修正。","tags":["glossary","transform","reset"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"转换","category":"other-keyword"}}
{"id":"kb-cooperation-059","collection":"game-mechanics-glossary","title":"协力","type":"glossary","stability":"medium","sourceUrl":"https://kards.fandom.com/zh/wiki/%E8%AF%8D%E6%9D%A1","sourceTitle":"KARDS Wiki Fandom 词条","summary":"若回合开始时场上没有同国家友军，使用协力牌会让总部受到士气伤害。","content":"使用带协力的卡牌时，如果回合开始时场上没有相同国家的友方单位，总部会受到士气伤害。协力的本质是对国家协同条件的要求，不满足条件就要付出额外代价。","tags":["glossary","cooperation","nation-synergy"],"metadata":{"sourceType":"fandom-wiki","keyword":"协力","category":"other-keyword"}}
